---
title: "invest (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_timing: contract not paused
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: block.timestamp outside [startTime, endTime]
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert SaleNotActive
    q_check_timing --> q_verify_sig: within active sale period
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: signature invalid
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_min: signature valid
    q_check_min --> q_revert_min: amount < minimumInvestAmount
    q_revert_min --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvestment
    q_check_min --> q_validate_ecies: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_validate_ecies --> q_check_salt: validate encrypted bid EC point
    q_check_salt --> q_revert_salt: encryption salt != investor address
    q_revert_salt --> [*]: revert InvalidEncryptionSalt
    q_check_salt --> q_transfer: salt == investor address
    q_transfer --> q_update: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update --> [*]: update position, store encryptedBid, emit Invested

    note right of q_validate_ecies
        INV-001: encrypted bid uses ECIES with contract public key
        INV-002: encryption salt must equal investor address (prevents bid copying)
    end note

    note right of q_check_min
        INV-003: capital amount is visible on-chain, bid allocation is encrypted
        INV-004: bid privacy preserved until decryption key released
    end note
